{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Tq49D1TtHPz9wm8iduepyA","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Memory — exec-sim-repair-verifier\n2\t\n3\t## 关键发现\n4\t\n5\t### [2026-05-11] CWM Baseline ≈ Classification 在函数级（Negative for Core Claim 1）\n6\t- CWM generation: acc 87.51%, pass_f1 87.31%, fail_f1 87.71%\n7\t- Classification: acc 87.5%, pass_f1 87.1%, fail_f1 87.9%\n8\t- 差值 <0.2pp，统计上无显著差异\n9\t- **关键洞察**: 函数级代码太简单——execution output 短、错误类型可预测，generation 不受 CWM failure modes（token exhaustion, BPE string prediction）影响。Classification 优势可能只在 repo-level 复杂代码上显现。\n10\t- CWM exact match 84%，但 IndexError/OverflowError 仅 25%/0%——罕见错误类型泛化差\n11\t- Classification 仍有效率优势（推理 1 token vs 多 token）\n12\t\n13\t### [2026-05-11] P2P Regression Rate ≈ 1% — 项目核心前提受挑战\n14\t- 77% 的错误 patch 不破坏任何 P2P 测试\n15\t- Per-test 在 Total 测试上的优势为负\n16\t\n17\t### [2026-05-11] MVP-B 强 Pass\n18\t- 87.5% acc, F1 87.1/87.9%, majority baseline 52%, gap +35.5pp\n19\t- Qwen3-4B LoRA, 19K function-level data\n20\t\n21\t## 项目状态总结\n22\t两个 reframed claims 均受挑战：\n23\t1. \"Classification > Generation\" → 函数级无差异，需 repo-level 验证\n24\t2. \"Per-test granularity > trajectory\" → P2P reg ≈1%，Total 优势为负\n25\t\n26\t## 决策记录\n27\t\n28\t### [2026-05-11] CWM Negative → 需要 Director 决策\n29\t选项：(A) 承认函数级无差异，论文 claim 改为\"classification 在效率上优于 generation，accuracy 等价\" (B) 认为真正的差距在 repo-level，追加 repo-level 实验 (C) Kill\n30\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"45f52b71-ca72-4ad0-bac1-693139d71240","uuid":"5b90bddd-7cae-4a0b-a78e-ca284d25118b","timestamp":"2026-05-11T23:18:32.520Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_16/projects/exec-sim-repair-verifier/memory.md","content":"# Memory — exec-sim-repair-verifier\n\n## 关键发现\n\n### [2026-05-11] CWM Baseline ≈ Classification 在函数级（Negative for Core Claim 1）\n- CWM generation: acc 87.51%, pass_f1 87.31%, fail_f1 87.71%\n- Classification: acc 87.5%, pass_f1 87.1%, fail_f1 87.9%\n- 差值 <0.2pp，统计上无显著差异\n- **关键洞察**: 函数级代码太简单——execution output 短、错误类型可预测，generation 不受 CWM failure modes（token exhaustion, BPE string prediction）影响。Classification 优势可能只在 repo-level 复杂代码上显现。\n- CWM exact match 84%，但 IndexError/OverflowError 仅 25%/0%——罕见错误类型泛化差\n- Classification 仍有效率优势（推理 1 token vs 多 token）\n\n### [2026-05-11] P2P Regression Rate ≈ 1% — 项目核心前提受挑战\n- 77% 的错误 patch 不破坏任何 P2P 测试\n- Per-test 在 Total 测试上的优势为负\n\n### [2026-05-11] MVP-B 强 Pass\n- 87.5% acc, F1 87.1/87.9%, majority baseline 52%, gap +35.5pp\n- Qwen3-4B LoRA, 19K function-level data\n\n## 项目状态总结\n两个 reframed claims 均受挑战：\n1. \"Classification > Generation\" → 函数级无差异，需 repo-level 验证\n2. \"Per-test granularity > trajectory\" → P2P reg ≈1%，Total 优势为负\n\n## 决策记录\n\n### [2026-05-11] CWM Negative → 需要 Director 决策\n选项：(A) 承认函数级无差异，论文 claim 改为\"classification 在效率上优于 generation，accuracy 等价\" (B) 认为真正的差距在 repo-level，追加 repo-level 实验 (C) Kill\n","numLines":30,"startLine":1,"totalLines":30}}}
