{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01McqB6s4EJS3jW3xMSLKvCb","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# exec-sim-repair-verifier — Research Dashboard\n2\t\n3\t> 最后更新: 2026-05-11 22:32 UTC | 更新原因: D007: CWM negative on function-level, pivot to complexity-dependent framing, update task list\n4\t\n5\t## 核心方向\n6\tTask reformulation: execution simulation 从 generation → classification。**函数级两者等价（F1 diff <0.2pp），核心假说转为 complexity-dependent advantage——repo-level 是决胜战场。** 详见 paper_framing.md。\n7\t\n8\t## 当前进展\n9\t- **阶段**: Research（MVP 已通过，post-MVP 实验中）\n10\t- **关键发现**: CWM generation ≈ classification on function-level（D007）。不触发 kill condition（差异未达 3pp），但 Claim 1 需要 repo-level 数据支撑\n11\t- **Story pillars**:\n12\t  - Pillar 1 (Classification vs Generation): ⚠️ 函数级 null result，需 repo-level 验证\n13\t  - Pillar 2 (Diagnostic Signals): ⚠️ 待 downstream re-repair 验证\n14\t  - Pillar 3 (Oracle Frontier): ✅ 模拟数据完成（MVP-A）\n15\t- **Dream**: phase2 bug（Paper Agent 未生成 .tex），已报 Manager 提 issue\n16\t\n17\t## 近期任务\n18\t- [ ] Multi-seed 验证：3 seeds 确认函数级 null result（~3h，正在跑）\n19\t- [ ] Inference cost 测量：classification 1-token vs generation N-token（并行）\n20\t- [ ] SWE-bench per-test 数据 pipeline 方案设计（Agent 设计中）\n21\t- [ ] SWE-bench per-test 数据构建（Docker 执行，~16-24h）— 待方案审批\n22\t- [ ] Repo-level classification vs generation 训练 + eval — 待数据就绪\n23\t- [ ] paper_framing.md 已更新为 Complexity-Dependent Advantage\n24\t\n25\t## GPU 预算\n26\t- 分配: home-1x5090 cuda:0 (1× RTX 5090)\n27\t- 当前: multi-seed training 占用中\n28\t\n29\t## 时间线\n30\t- ARR May 25, 2026（14 天）\n31\t- 关键路径: SWE-bench 数据(~24h) → repo-level 训练(~8-16h) → eval → 写作(3-5d)\n32\t\n33\t## 关键决策日志\n34\t\n35\t| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\n36\t|----|------|------|----------|\n37\t| D008 | 2026-05-11 | Reviewer critical acknowledged; stay D007 course w | cwm-baseline, swebench-pertest-data |\n38\t| D007 | 2026-05-11 | CWM negative on function-level: adopt Complexity-D | cwm-baseline |\n39\t| D006 | 2026-05-11 | MVP 通过，进入 Research 阶段；P0 = CWM generation baseline | mvp-b-data-prep, mvp-b-train |\n40\t| D005 | 2026-05-11 | Reframe 后的验证优先级：P0 CWM baseline 对比 > P1 Diagnostic | — |\n41\t| D004 | 2026-05-11 | P2P 回归率 ~1%，原始 Total 优势前提不成立；项目 reframe 而非 kill | mvp-a-oracle-sim |\n42\t| D003 | 2026-05-11 | P2P regression rate 是项目关键前提——≥10% per-test 有效，<5%  | mvp-a-oracle-sim |\n43\t| D002 | 2026-05-11 | MVP-A 有条件通过：F2P-only block-corr 10.88%>5%；需补跑 Tota | mvp-a-oracle-sim |\n44\t| D001 | 2026-05-11 | MVP 方案: Monte Carlo oracle 模拟 + 函数级 pilot，不依赖 Dock | — |\n45\t\n46\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"45f52b71-ca72-4ad0-bac1-693139d71240","uuid":"64ab1726-482a-4af4-b844-a3b1e782d354","timestamp":"2026-05-11T23:18:39.639Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_16/projects/exec-sim-repair-verifier/ROADMAP.md","content":"# exec-sim-repair-verifier — Research Dashboard\n\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-11 22:32 UTC | 更新原因: D007: CWM negative on function-level, pivot to complexity-dependent framing, update task list\n\n## 核心方向\nTask reformulation: execution simulation 从 generation → classification。**函数级两者等价（F1 diff <0.2pp），核心假说转为 complexity-dependent advantage——repo-level 是决胜战场。** 详见 paper_framing.md。\n\n## 当前进展\n- **阶段**: Research（MVP 已通过，post-MVP 实验中）\n- **关键发现**: CWM generation ≈ classification on function-level（D007）。不触发 kill condition（差异未达 3pp），但 Claim 1 需要 repo-level 数据支撑\n- **Story pillars**:\n  - Pillar 1 (Classification vs Generation): ⚠️ 函数级 null result，需 repo-level 验证\n  - Pillar 2 (Diagnostic Signals): ⚠️ 待 downstream re-repair 验证\n  - Pillar 3 (Oracle Frontier): ✅ 模拟数据完成（MVP-A）\n- **Dream**: phase2 bug（Paper Agent 未生成 .tex），已报 Manager 提 issue\n\n## 近期任务\n- [ ] Multi-seed 验证：3 seeds 确认函数级 null result（~3h，正在跑）\n- [ ] Inference cost 测量：classification 1-token vs generation N-token（并行）\n- [ ] SWE-bench per-test 数据 pipeline 方案设计（Agent 设计中）\n- [ ] SWE-bench per-test 数据构建（Docker 执行，~16-24h）— 待方案审批\n- [ ] Repo-level classification vs generation 训练 + eval — 待数据就绪\n- [ ] paper_framing.md 已更新为 Complexity-Dependent Advantage\n\n## GPU 预算\n- 分配: home-1x5090 cuda:0 (1× RTX 5090)\n- 当前: multi-seed training 占用中\n\n## 时间线\n- ARR May 25, 2026（14 天）\n- 关键路径: SWE-bench 数据(~24h) → repo-level 训练(~8-16h) → eval → 写作(3-5d)\n\n## 关键决策日志\n\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\n|----|------|------|----------|\n| D008 | 2026-05-11 | Reviewer critical acknowledged; stay D007 course w | cwm-baseline, swebench-pertest-data |\n| D007 | 2026-05-11 | CWM negative on function-level: adopt Complexity-D | cwm-baseline |\n| D006 | 2026-05-11 | MVP 通过，进入 Research 阶段；P0 = CWM generation baseline | mvp-b-data-prep, mvp-b-train |\n| D005 | 2026-05-11 | Reframe 后的验证优先级：P0 CWM baseline 对比 > P1 Diagnostic | — |\n| D004 | 2026-05-11 | P2P 回归率 ~1%，原始 Total 优势前提不成立；项目 reframe 而非 kill | mvp-a-oracle-sim |\n| D003 | 2026-05-11 | P2P regression rate 是项目关键前提——≥10% per-test 有效，<5%  | mvp-a-oracle-sim |\n| D002 | 2026-05-11 | MVP-A 有条件通过：F2P-only block-corr 10.88%>5%；需补跑 Tota | mvp-a-oracle-sim |\n| D001 | 2026-05-11 | MVP 方案: Monte Carlo oracle 模拟 + 函数级 pilot，不依赖 Dock | — |\n\n","numLines":46,"startLine":1,"totalLines":46}}}
